  <h2>UX, responsive &amp; accessibility requirements</h2>
  <p><strong>Key interface elements</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Persistent header: logo, main navigation, a prominent <em>Get Tickets</em>
      / <em>Plan Your Visit</em> button.
    </li>
    <li>
      Homepage hero featuring the current exhibition, with today's hours visible
      above the fold.
    </li>
    <li>Reusable cards for exhibitions, artworks, artists and events.</li>
    <li>
      Footer: address, hours, contact email, newsletter sign-up, social links.
    </li>
    <li>Mobile: hamburger or bottom menu; tap targets at least 44×44px.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Responsive frames (Figma and code)</strong></p>
  <table>
    <colgroup>
      <col />
      <col />
      <col />
    </colgroup>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Breakpoint</p></th>
        <th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Width</p></th>
        <th colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Layout</p></th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Mobile</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>320px</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>1 column, stacked cards</p></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Tablet</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>768px</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>2 columns</p></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>Desktop</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>1440px</p></td>
        <td colspan="1" rowspan="1"><p>12-column grid, 3–4 card rows</p></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p><strong>Accessibility baseline</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic HTML (header, nav, main, footer, headings in order).</li>
    <li>
      Alt text for all artwork and photos; describe the art, not just its title.
    </li>
    <li>Color contrast at WCAG AA; never use color alone to convey meaning.</li>
    <li>Visible focus states and full keyboard navigation.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Deadlines and Grading Criteria:</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td
          ><br />
          <strong>Description</strong></td
        >
        <td><p><strong>Due Date</strong></p></td>
        <td><p><strong>Points</strong></p></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><p>Research</p></td>
        <td><p>11/11</p></td>
        <td><p>20</p></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><p>Sitemap</p></td>
        <td><p>11/11</p></td>
        <td><p>20</p></td>
      </tr>
